    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Matrix traversal</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Simulation</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/spiral-matrix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 54</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Spiral Matrix</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Keep four walls (top, bottom, left, right) around the part not read yet. Read one side, push that wall inward, repeat. Guard the last two sides of each lap so a single leftover row or column is not read twice. O(m·n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
